# Copy this file to `updater.pubkey` and paste the public key generated by:
#   pnpm tauri signer generate -w ~/.tauri/aaai.key
#
# Public key is also in `tauri.conf.json` → plugins.updater.pubkey.
# Private key: keep in ~/.tauri/aaai.key or GitHub Secret TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY.
#
# Release docs: docs/release.zh-CN.md
